    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "乐乐、高红、小天和爸爸一起做了晚饭。",
      "traditional": "樂樂、高紅、小天和爸爸一起做了晚飯。",
      "pinyin": "lè lè gāo hóng xiǎo tiān hé bà ba yì qǐ zuò le wǎn fàn",
      "english": "Lele, Gao Hong, Little Tian, and Dad cooked dinner together."
    },
    {
