      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "高红做的菜很好吃，小天看着高兴的爸爸，他也很高兴。",
      "traditional": "高紅做的菜很好吃，小天看著高興的爸爸，他也很高興。",
      "pinyin": "gāo hóng zuò de cài hěn hǎo chī xiǎo tiān kàn zhe gāo xìng de bà ba tā yě hěn gāo xìng",
      "english": "Gao Hong’s cooking was delicious. Seeing his dad happy also made Little Tian happy."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "吃完饭，小天说：“乐乐，让你妈妈和我爸爸在家看电视，我们出去喝咖啡吧。”",
      "traditional": "吃完飯，小天說：“樂樂，讓你媽媽和我爸爸在家看電視，我們出去喝咖啡吧。”",
      "pinyin": "chī wán fàn xiǎo tiān shuō lè lè ràng nǐ mā ma hé wǒ bà ba zài jiā kàn diàn shì wǒ men chū qù hē kā fēi ba",
      "english": "After dinner, Little Tian said, “Lele, your mom and my dad can watch TV at home. Let’s go out and get coffee.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "乐乐懂了，她笑着说：“好的。”",
