    "sentence_translations": [
      "Chapter 20: Mom Will Know",
      "",
      "Lele, Gao Hong, Little Tian, and Dad cooked dinner together.",
      "",
      "Gao Hong’s cooking was delicious. Seeing his dad happy also made Little Tian happy.",
      "",
      "After dinner, Little Tian said, “Lele, your mom and my dad can watch TV at home. Let’s go out and get coffee.”",
      "",
      "Lele understood. She smiled and said, “Okay.”",
      "",
      "They got to the coffee shop. Little Tian stood outside looking at the coffee shop, but he still wouldn’t go inside.",
      "",
      "“Little Tian, is this the coffee shop that your mom worked at?” Lele asked.",
      "",
      "“Yes.”",
      "",
      "“Why aren’t you going inside?”",
      "",
      "“Because Mom isn’t inside.”",
      "",
      "Lele thought about it and said, “I understand. Then let’s not get coffee anymore. Let’s go back.”",
      "",
      "Little Tian did not leave. He said, “No, I want to go inside today. I want to let Mom know that I am very happy now.”",
      "",
      "“Little Tian, your mom will know,” Lele said."
    ]
  }
